  "headline": "Senator Skye Kakoschke-Moore to resign over British citizenship by descent",
  "summary": "Nick Xenophon Team senator Skye Kakoschke-Moore will resign from the Senate after receiving advice that she holds British citizenship by descent through her mother, who was born in Singapore in 1957. She had believed she was not British based on earlier advice to her father. She will ask for a High Court referral to determine how her vacancy should be filled and intends to continue running for the NXT.",
  "possible_outcome": "A recount of the 2016 Senate ballot could install NXT candidate Tim Storrer, though Xenophon said the party has preliminary legal advice the vacancy may not be filled by recount, calling the situation legally uncharted following a recent High Court decision involving Hollie Hughes.",
  "reaction": "Xenophon and colleagues said they were devastated by her loss but predicted it may not end her political career."
}

